  "description": "Provider-neutral EF Core infrastructure for Whimclean applications, including required current-user writes, shadow-property audit stamps and soft deletion (HasAuditStamps, HasSoftDelete), concurrency handling, unit-of-work registration, list query helpers, and domain-event dispatch.",
