  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0: audit stamps and soft deletion move from domain interfaces to shadow properties. Opt entity types in with HasAuditStamps() and HasSoftDelete() in ConfigureModel; Remove() soft-deletes configured types, HardDelete() deletes the row, Restore() reverses a soft delete, IsSoftDeleted() reads the flag. Property names are in AuditStampNames and SoftDeleteNames. See https://github.com/athene-x/Whimclean/blob/main/docs/upgrading-to-2.0.md.",
